      "Cook the lentils in plenty of boiling water for 20 minutes until just tender. Drain and keep warm.",
      "Heat 1 tbsp oil in a pot, stir in the rice and 400 ml water with salt. Cook covered for 15 minutes until done. Meanwhile cook the macaroni in salted water per packet instructions and drain.",
      "For the tomato sauce, fry the garlic in oil for 30 seconds, add the tomatoes, vinegar, cumin and chilli. Simmer for 20 minutes until thick, and season.",
      "For the garlic vinegar, mix the garlic, vinegar, water, cumin and a pinch of salt and leave to infuse.",
      "For the onions, toss the slices in the flour and a pinch of salt. Fry in batches in hot oil, stirring, until deep golden and crisp. Drain on paper.",
      "Layer the rice, lentils, macaroni and chickpeas in bowls, spoon over tomato sauce, a little garlic vinegar and crown with the fried onions."
